    "title": "Humane Society for Hamilton County to 'Clear the Shelters' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Current Publishing ,\n6 hours ago The Humane Society for Hamilton County has scheduled a “Clear the Shelters” event to encourage adoptions and reduce the number of animals waiting for a new home. “We have run out of space and our animals are running out of hope as they wait months — or even years — to find their forever homes,” a news release stated. “Every kennel, office and pop-up crate has been full since late June, with over 600 animals currently in the building.” Read full article\n1",
